  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Poltica Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Policy Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacion es contribuir a mejorar el capital humano de los pobres a fin de romper con el ciclo inter-generacional de la pobreza, contribuyendo a la implementacin de la Estrategia Nacional de Eliminacin de la Pobreza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to contribute to improving the human capital of the poor, in order to break the inter-generational cycle of poverty, by supporting the implementation of the National Poverty Elimination Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
